        "reason": "保留同伴提出的字段分离工作假设，并将其延伸为需要辨明合成和方向归一化的先后；近单位范数本身仍不能确认算法。",
        "source": "/Applications/ideas/research/hypothesis_continuation_20261109/runtime/ours_source/runs/hypothesis_flexible_optical_generation/stages/02_initial_1/api_v2/workspace/result.json"
